Hi,

Thanks for your interest in CODEX. For the fractional mode, the segmentation can occur as either large region with neutral copy numbers or small region with non-neutral copy numbers. The first occasion isn’t interesting (whose estimated copy number is close to 2). If you look at the column named ‘copy_no’ in the output you attached, you can filter out segments with copy number close to 2. We used 1.7 and 2.3 for our cancer genomics sequencing pipeline.

Hope this answers your question. I am cc’ing our mailing list in case other users have similar questions.

Cheers,
Yuchao

